Package: libdaqp0.10
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: dual active-set solver for convex quadratic programs
 DAQP solves convex quadratic programs, and linear ones, with linear
 inequality and equality constraints and simple bounds by a dual active-set
 method, which can be warm started from the working set of a previous solve;
 it also handles soft constraints, hierarchical problems and, by branch and
 bound, binary variables.
 .
 This package holds the shared library.

Package: libdaqp-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Section: libdevel
Depends: libdaqp0.10 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: dual active-set solver for convex QPs (development files)
 DAQP solves convex quadratic programs, and linear ones, with linear
 inequality and equality constraints and simple bounds by a dual active-set
 method, which can be warm started from the working set of a previous solve;
 it also handles soft constraints, hierarchical problems and, by branch and
 bound, binary variables.
 .
 This package holds the headers, the static library and the CMake
 configuration that find_package(daqp) finds.
